If `sflixStreams` is `undefined`, the spread will fail. `fetchWithTimeout` should resolve to `[]` on timeout. The catch block resolves to `[]`. So `sflixDirect.getStreamsBySlug` must be returning something non-array and *not throwing* (or the error isn't caught properly).

