- **Smart Mapping**: Automatically maps HiTV/SFlix discovery items to Zenith (KissKH) and Nova (SFlix) streams.
- **Anime Catalog**: Full HiAnime v1 catalog integration with server discovery and extraction.
- **Proxy**: Built-in m3u8 proxy for bypassing CORS with IPv4 failover and security token rotation.

## 🔒 Authentication
Currently public. Future versions may implement API Key protection.
